{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方第一段白色大号粗体文字，红色竖线进一步强化入口；随后下方第二、第三段同样醒目的白色粗体文字争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他愿意继续陪在对方身边，不再隐藏自己的喜欢。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、愿意主动靠近；当下究竟是高兴还是心疼，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他因自己的在乎而感到高兴，却又意识到对方以后是否愿意陪伴不是自己能决定的，因此欢喜转为心口发疼。感受变化及其原因需要结合后两段才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块大号白色文字视觉权重接近，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"单块文字较长，包含多层意思，不能只看局部就完整理解。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在三块里：第一块交代愿意陪伴和表达喜欢，第二块交代高兴，第三块交代不确定性及心疼，需要拼接才能理解处境、感受及两者关系。\",\n    \"右上角阶段目录字号较小，连续排列，第一眼不容易读取具体阶段。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9d976ddb-0e44-4828-8286-f94af137afaa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T031141751826Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:12:07.718384+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e745dc9612f8167345232525e40908e68f9a8be097667c1c5a7dd990e4dd960f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83